silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_02_typed_source_signature_sections_01_sorts_as_objects_concrete_anchor_12#coconeapexnode silm:hasLongDescription "The CoconeApexNode is the apex object emitted by the colimit-cocone gluing. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'CocomeApex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
